# Roles and Approvals

| Role | Owner | Approval Scope |
|---|---|---|
| Security Owner | {{SECURITY_OWNER}} | G0, G1, release risk |
| Architecture Owner | {{ARCHITECTURE_OWNER}} | Architecture and baseline |
| Verification Owner | {{VERIFICATION_OWNER}} | G3, G4 evidence |
| Knowledge/Skill Maintainer | {{SKILL_MAINTAINER}} | Promotion packaging |
| Feature Owner |  | Per-change scope |
| Reviewer |  | Independent G4/G5 review |

Automation may prepare review material but cannot approve on behalf of these roles.
